        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: KAGB, KAPA\n- Places: Waimea, Hawaiʻi County, Hawaiʻi, United States\n- Topics: Radio broadcasting, census population\n\nFacts:\n- KAGB (99.1 FM) is a radio station that broadcasts an Adult Contemporary format and simulcasts Hilo-based KAPA.\n- KAGB is licensed to Waimea, Hawaiʻi, United States.\n- Waimea is a census-designated place in Hawaiʻi County, Hawaiʻi, United States.\n- Waimea had a population of 7,028 in the 2000 census.\n- Waimea had a population of 9,212 in the 2010 census.",
